  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I am your father. I am the father of all of you!\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son responds politely to his father.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a great honor for the family and we are all proud of you.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) stands beside eldest son",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now my son, there is the old house in the town,\"",
  "[action] smiles",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"That old house is mine, and I have a son who is an officer and a son who is a merchant, and there are men in my house who are worth more than all my uncles were together.\"",
  "[action] The second son looks at his father and smiles.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Ah, and your father is a man!\"",
